                  <name>value4</name>
                  <description> ADAPTIVE, adapt distance between falling edges 2, 3 bit Time constant 32; distance between falling edges 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 bit Time constant 16; distance between falling edges 9, 10 bit Time constant 8</description>
                  <value>3</value>
